Further parts of this directory (rules.json, and index.ts as a TypeScript
port) are derived from other third-party work licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. rules.json is unmodified except that a leading "//"
comment line was removed so the file is valid JSON.

Modifications (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)): index.ts is a modified
version of C# source, translated to TypeScript for Nadeshiko. The rule
semantics, growth guards, result ordering and cache policy follow the
original; thread-safety primitives and optional timing counters were
dropped because the port runs single-threaded.
